bbcode_enabled = true
bbcode_text = "[center][b]Hi everyone!
The big update is here - including the Engineer, 
neutral and class items for all existing classes and 
several quality-of-life features!

We are so excited to finally get it out there and 
hope you will like it [img=0x40]res://Assets/Character/StaminaUsage_1.png[/img]

You will hear from us soon with the usual fixes and 
balance adjustments to get the new stuff in line.

Doro and Mario [img=0x28]res://Assets/Heart.png[/img]
[/b][/center]

[b]New Content[/b]

o NEW CLASS: Engineer!
 
o 35 NEW ITEMS for the other classes

o NEW MODE: Switch Mode (Ranked & Unranked)

o Added a toggleable toolbar on the bottom of the screen 
   where you can access undo/redo. 
   Pushing items to storage was moved inside the toolbar.

o Added modes to only edit bags or only edit items, where 
   they can be moved freely independent of each other 
   (can be accessed via the toolbar).

o Added grid storage mode (can be accessed via the toolbar). 
   Can be zoomed with Ctrl+mouse wheel.

o Added text animations for item names (can be toggled in Options).

o Added Keybinds: Undo/Redo, switching between the new 
   inventory edit modes, toggle grid storage (G by default), 
   showing recipe tooltips (Alt by default), open library (Tab by default)

o Combat: The swords on the status UI now move according
    to player/opponent health + Block totals.

o History: Now shows rank gains and losses.
   Added filters for classes and modes.
   Now only shows the version of a run if it differs from the current 
   game version. 
   Now shows the number of items and the distinct types. 
   History runs can now be marked as opponent with right click.

o Item Library: Ingredients etc. on the info panel can now be 
   spotlighted by clicking them. 
   Library can now be zoomed with Ctrl+mouse wheel.

o Shop: BGM now has a chance to play the lobby mode / switch mode 
   track in ranked/unranked for variety. 
   Added an animation when an item comes up in the shop 
   that can craft with another item.

o Controller Support: Added right stick jumping between points 
   of interest. D-Pad now scrolls scrollbars.

o Title Screen: Falling items now react to your cursor

[b]Balance[/b]
[center][b]Neutral[/b][/center]
o Pandamonium now gives 3% Poison crit chance per ⭐Food
o Holy Spear: Damage -3
o Shelly: Cooldown 12s -> 13s, speed up per Potion 15% -> 20%
o Darksaber: Damage +2
o Bloodthorne: Stamina cost 1.6 -> 1.5
o Shield of Valor: Cost 12g -> 11g
o Serpent Staff: Poison duplication chance 35% -> 40%
o Stone Helm: Critical hit resistance 25% -> 30%
o Vampiric Armor: Health used 45 -> 50, Vampirism 2 -> 4.
o Burning Coal (Armor): Cold resist 6 -> 7
o Frozen Buckler: Stamina removal 0.7 -> 0.8
o Frostbite: Vampirism 7 -> 8
o Ice Armor: Block 80 -> 90
o Fortuna’s Kiss: Cooldown 4s -> 3.5s
o Full Body Protection: Cooldown 4.5s -> 4s
o Spicy Banana: Chance 85% -> 50%, Heat 1 -> 2
o Lil Chestnut: Trade chance 30% -> 40%

[center][b]Ranger[/b][/center]
o Piercing Arrow: Luck generation chance 40% -> 35%
o White Lily Collar: Gains Holy type, chance 35% -> 30%
o Snowmaster: Cooldown 1.5s -> 1.3s
o Hedgehog: Spikes 2 -> 3
o Hyper Hedgehog: Spikes 3 -> 4
o Vineweave Basket: Heal amplification 10% -> 12%

[center][b]Reaper[/b][/center]
o The Fool: Cost 3g -> 2g
o Ice Dragon: Block 60 -> 75
o Relic Case: Cooldown 2.8s -> 2.7s
o Heart of the Cards: Mana 4 -> 5
o Staff of Unhealing: Heal 28 -> 30

[center][b]Pyromancer[/b][/center]
o Molten Spear: Now also counts empty slots
o Burning Banner: Cooldown 3.8s ->  4.0s
o Chili Goobert: Heal 15 -> 16
o Phoenix: Gains a gemstone socket

[center][b]Berserker[/b][/center]
o Spiked Wall: Gains 2 gemstone sockets
o Extra Angy: Delay 2s -> 1s
o Dragon Set: Lifesteal limit 25% -> 30%

[center][b]Mage[/b][/center]
o Water Elemental: Gains 1 gemstone socket and Ice type
o Chess Board: Cooldown 0.7s -> 0.8s
o Devouring Sphere: Cooldown 1.7s -> 1.5s
o Lantern Berry: Cooldown 2.1s -> 2.0s
o Badger Spirit Companion: Cooldown 4.5s -> 4.7s
o Cat Spirit Companion: Cooldown 3.7s -> 3.4s
o Nature Chronicles: Trees: Cooldown 2.5s -> 2.3s
o Ultima Ascension: Luck 1 -> 2

[center][b]Adventurer[/b][/center]
o Mercury Elemental: Damage as Block 45% -> 50%. Gains 1 gemstone
   socket 


[b]Other[/b]

o Added an animation when inventory cannot be shifted because 
   it is already at the border
o Added animations for subclass/skill appearance
o Added an animation when a crafting connection could not be 
   started because the item is already part of a different recipe
o Added an animation when starting a recipe
o Added animations when changing character and loadout
o Added an animation when switching between builds in history
o Added more visual feedback for the random-character button
o Added buff icon for maximum health gain
o Added a particle effect for the “Start Battle” button
o When crafting recipes with more than 2 ingredients, 
   missing ingredients are now shown; improved layouting 
   of crafting texts


[b]1.1.0b[/b]

o Updated translations, small fixes"
text = "Hi everyone!
The big update is here - including the Engineer, 
neutral and class items for all existing classes and 
several quality-of-life features!

We are so excited to finally get it out there and 
hope you will like it 

You will hear from us soon with the usual fixes and 
balance adjustments to get the new stuff in line.

Doro and Mario 


New Content

o NEW CLASS: Engineer!
 
o 35 NEW ITEMS for the other classes

o NEW MODE: Switch Mode (Ranked & Unranked)

o Added a toggleable toolbar on the bottom of the screen 
   where you can access undo/redo. 
   Pushing items to storage was moved inside the toolbar.

o Added modes to only edit bags or only edit items, where 
   they can be moved freely independent of each other 
   (can be accessed via the toolbar).

o Added grid storage mode (can be accessed via the toolbar). 
   Can be zoomed with Ctrl+mouse wheel.

o Added text animations for item names (can be toggled in Options).

o Added Keybinds: Undo/Redo, switching between the new 
   inventory edit modes, toggle grid storage (G by default), 
   showing recipe tooltips (Alt by default), open library (Tab by default)

o Combat: The swords on the status UI now move according
    to player/opponent health + Block totals.

o History: Now shows rank gains and losses.
   Added filters for classes and modes.
   Now only shows the version of a run if it differs from the current 
   game version. 
   Now shows the number of items and the distinct types. 
   History runs can now be marked as opponent with right click.

o Item Library: Ingredients etc. on the info panel can now be 
   spotlighted by clicking them. 
   Library can now be zoomed with Ctrl+mouse wheel.

o Shop: BGM now has a chance to play the lobby mode / switch mode 
   track in ranked/unranked for variety. 
   Added an animation when an item comes up in the shop 
   that can craft with another item.

o Controller Support: Added right stick jumping between points 
   of interest. D-Pad now scrolls scrollbars.

o Title Screen: Falling items now react to your cursor

Balance
Neutral
o Pandamonium now gives 3% Poison crit chance per ⭐Food
o Holy Spear: Damage -3
o Shelly: Cooldown 12s -> 13s, speed up per Potion 15% -> 20%
o Darksaber: Damage +2
o Bloodthorne: Stamina cost 1.6 -> 1.5
o Shield of Valor: Cost 12g -> 11g
o Serpent Staff: Poison duplication chance 35% -> 40%
o Stone Helm: Critical hit resistance 25% -> 30%
o Vampiric Armor: Health used 45 -> 50, Vampirism 2 -> 4.
o Burning Coal (Armor): Cold resist 6 -> 7
o Frozen Buckler: Stamina removal 0.7 -> 0.8
o Frostbite: Vampirism 7 -> 8
o Ice Armor: Block 80 -> 90
o Fortuna’s Kiss: Cooldown 4s -> 3.5s
o Full Body Protection: Cooldown 4.5s -> 4s
o Spicy Banana: Chance 85% -> 50%, Heat 1 -> 2
o Lil Chestnut: Trade chance 30% -> 40%

Ranger
o Piercing Arrow: Luck generation chance 40% -> 35%
o White Lily Collar: Gains Holy type, chance 35% -> 30%
o Snowmaster: Cooldown 1.5s -> 1.3s
o Hedgehog: Spikes 2 -> 3
o Hyper Hedgehog: Spikes 3 -> 4
o Vineweave Basket: Heal amplification 10% -> 12%

Reaper
o The Fool: Cost 3g -> 2g
o Ice Dragon: Block 60 -> 75
o Relic Case: Cooldown 2.8s -> 2.7s
o Heart of the Cards: Mana 4 -> 5
o Staff of Unhealing: Heal 28 -> 30

Pyromancer
o Molten Spear: Now also counts empty slots
o Burning Banner: Cooldown 3.8s ->  4.0s
o Chili Goobert: Heal 15 -> 16
o Phoenix: Gains a gemstone socket

Berserker
o Spiked Wall: Gains 2 gemstone sockets
o Extra Angy: Delay 2s -> 1s
o Dragon Set: Lifesteal limit 25% -> 30%

Mage
o Water Elemental: Gains 1 gemstone socket and Ice type
o Chess Board: Cooldown 0.7s -> 0.8s
o Devouring Sphere: Cooldown 1.7s -> 1.5s
o Lantern Berry: Cooldown 2.1s -> 2.0s
o Badger Spirit Companion: Cooldown 4.5s -> 4.7s
o Cat Spirit Companion: Cooldown 3.7s -> 3.4s
o Nature Chronicles: Trees: Cooldown 2.5s -> 2.3s
o Ultima Ascension: Luck 1 -> 2

Adventurer
o Mercury Elemental: Damage as Block 45% -> 50%. Gains 1 gemstone
   socket 


Other

o Added an animation when inventory cannot be shifted because 
   it is already at the border
o Added animations for subclass/skill appearance
o Added an animation when a crafting connection could not be 
   started because the item is already part of a different recipe
o Added an animation when starting a recipe
o Added animations when changing character and loadout
o Added an animation when switching between builds in history
o Added more visual feedback for the random-character button
o Added buff icon for maximum health gain
o Added a particle effect for the “Start Battle” button
o When crafting recipes with more than 2 ingredients, 
   missing ingredients are now shown; improved layouting 
   of crafting texts


1.1.0b

o Updated translations, small fixes"
